History
~~~~~~~
1.0  (1993-11-16) A version exclusivly for JAC/ADDONIC. It didn't have any
     config and it only stopped 2400 bps users from downloading.

2.0  (1993-12-30) First public release. Config icon with tooltypes
     LOWEST_SPEED, START, END and ACS.OVERRIDE, and all there's to it...
     Nicer look.

2.1  (1994-04-24) Second release version.
     The time format was changed from HH.MM to HH:MM.
     Certain users can now be excluded from the speed check. They are
     listed in the config icon with the tooltype NAME.x where x >= 1.


